Revision history for Genealogy-Occupation

0.02

      [BUG FIXES]
      - Fixed deduplication failing in non-English locales.  The dedup
        check compared $result[-1] (already translated) against the
        current pre-translation English form, so consecutive identical
        occupations were never collapsed in French or German.  Now tracks
        the last normalised English form in $last_normalised separately
        from the translated output array.

      [TEST FIXES]
      - English-locale subtests in unit.t, edge_cases.t, and
        extended_tests.t now delete local $ENV{LANGUAGE}, LC_ALL, and
        LC_MESSAGES before setting LANG=en_GB.UTF-8.  Without this,
        smokers with LC_ALL set to a non-English locale (reported by
        https://www.cpantesters.org/cpan/report/8ebd4948-4c33-11f1-a584-66046e8775ea on FreeBSD/de_DE) caused those subtests to detect
        German and produce translated output instead of English.

0.01	Sat May  9 16:46:21 EDT 2026
        First draft
